      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BAILEY DUTTON (4) goes very well over this trip including four wins. Comes off a (19.88) win last time, scoring by 3.5 lengths in a Grade 5 over 350m at this track. Rates a leading player. SAUSAGE GAMBLER (1) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by 2.25 lengths at this track in a handy 20.13 beating MISTY BONUS. One of the key runners again. KIA MCGRAW (8) looks close to another win after finishing second from Box 5 last time (20.11) at this track. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Overdue and expected to feature again. LOLLIPOP VALLEY (5) can add to a nice sequence of wins.",
